        "ult": "[Add-on] Strikes all enemies in a line for <#ff9028ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and <#f5f5f5ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>35% AD<> <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<> and <#ef5350ff>knocks them up<> for <#ffb900ff>0.75s<>; Yone appears behind the last champion struck, pulling them in. <#ff9028ff>Combo Q3 R<>: within <#ffb900ff>1.5s<> of Q3 knocking up a champion it cuts at once, without the wind-up; a champion hit adds a Mortal Steel stack (<#ff9028ff>R Q3<>)."
      }
    }
  },
